{
  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## Krista Gibson   Sales Manager\n\n![Krista Gibson headshot.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_9c9e8fa14a614ea89bef003d8da7774b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_221,h_303,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Krista%20Gibson%20headshot.jpg)\n\nCreating events to remember excites me and building relationships with my clients fills my cup.\n\nWith my extensive background in hospitality and my work with organizations all across the board, I am sure to meet your needs with enthusiasm and exceptional customer service.  My experience includes internal meeting planning and execution in the medical clinical trials industry as well as hotel inside sales with a special emphasis on the sectors of Social, Military/Government, Education, Religious, and Fraternal organizations.\n\n​\n\nRecognized as a Top 10 Business Travel Sales Managers in Interstate Hotel & Resorts Portfolio;  I pride myself in working with my clients to achive their goals.\n\n​\n\nI live in The Woodlands, Texas with my husband, daughter, and currently expecting a baby boy. I take pride in being the best wife and mother I can be and in my spare time, you can find me at dance lessons, baking, enjoying the outdoors, and with a camera in hand capturing special moments with family and friends.\n\n[![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_25,h_25,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png)\\\\\n\\\\\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/035244_ad00e9a4df534dccbc20a627b0861168~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_25,h_25,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/035244_ad00e9a4df534dccbc20a627b0861168~mv2.png)\\\\\n\\\\\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_25,h_25,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png)](mailto:krista@reachmeetings.com)\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
